        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\tApproximately Dimensions (m) \r\n\r\nFront canopy porch area \t\r\nEntrance hall \tc. 1.882m x 2.865m with tiled floor, new front door \r\nFront sitting room\tc. 4.086m x 4.08m with feature open fireplace with stippled ceiling, tiled and cast iron feature, carpet and cornicing, fitted display unit \r\nKitchen / dining \tc. 9.772m x 3.276m - open plan with new fitted kitchen with feature granite worktop, double electric oven and cooker unit, extract hood, Belfast sink,pantry/larder unit, integrated dishwasher & fridge freezer, plumbed for washing machine, tiled floors, recessed lights, coving, back door off ,\r\n                                                        Opening into family room to rear :\r\nFamily room area:\r\n(extension part) \t\tc. 4.375m x 4.448m with solid fuel stove with back boiler (radiators), built in storage seat units, laminate walnut floor, double patio doors, coving and recessed lights, expansive views to back garden and countryside \r\nCentral corridor \twith tiled floor, hot press \r\nBedroom 1 / Master\tc. 3.991m x 3.272m with fully tiled, carpet, built in wardrobe units \r\nEn-suite \tc. 0.949m x 2.359m with wc, whb, shower / wet room, fully tiled out.\r\nBedroom 2\twith carpet and fitted sliderobes\r\nBedroom 3\tc. 2.977m x 2.974m with carpet\r\nBathroom \tc. 2.055m x 3.248m fully tiled with wc, whb, bath, separate shower \r\nBedroom 4\tc. 2.989m x 2.98m with carpet \r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nSite area of approx. 0.593 Acre.\r\nFront entrance tarmac driveway and side drive wrap around \r\nSuperb raised deck area enclosed by low wall with array of plants \r\nConcrete built turf shed with double doors \r\nSmall animal shed with concrete floor with small concrete yard \r\nSteeltech shed – storage, ESB\r\nSpacious tarmac rear forecourt with side gates \r\nLarge rear lawned gardens – private, fenced and walled \r\nLawned and landscaped front garden"
